<title>USA: Mississippi Power redeems depositary shrs.</title>
<headline>Mississippi Power redeems depositary shrs.</headline>
<dateline>GULFPORT, Miss 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mississippi Power Co said Tuesday it will redeem on August 4 all outstanding depositary preferred shares representing its 7.25-percent series preferred stock series.</p>
<p>The company said the redemption price of the shares, which are evidenced by depositary receipts, will be $25.00 each, plus accrued dividends to the date of redemption.</p>
</text>
